Everything you need to plan your tournament!

Our main mission is to assist organizers in managing their tournaments, enabling them to share tables, match results, images, and videos, providing participants and spectators the opportunity to follow and interact with developments effectively.

You can enter the team and its coaching staff;

Individual statistics for teams, players, coaching staff, venues, and referees with all the information you need to track;

Editing your tournament and the information within it has never been easier;

Your tournaments are always secure;

Log in easily and quickly from the app or using the web version;

Delete your account and your data if you don't like it.

Print your results, dates, tables in PDF format.

Always have access to your tournament information.

Change your password easily, quickly, and securely.

We update the app every month.

Experience your tournaments like never before. Design and coordinate your own tournaments with ease.
